#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:4
msgid "Writing a logger"
msgstr "ロガーの作成"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:6
msgid ""
"A logger receives the logs of a simulation: the orders, cancels and "
"executions, and the beginning and end of the simulation, of each session "
"and of each market step. The built-in "
":class:`~pams.logs.MarketStepPrintLogger` and "
":class:`~pams.logs.MarketStepSaver` only record the market prices at each"
" step (see :doc:`first_simulation`). This tutorial writes a logger that "
"prints a summary of each session and saves every trade to a CSV file. The"
" complete script is :download:`tutorial_custom_logger.py "
"<code/tutorial_custom_logger.py>`."
msgstr ""
"ロガーはシミュレーションのログを受け取ります：注文、取消、約定、そしてシミュレーション、各セッション、各市場ステップの開始と終了です。組み込みの "
":class:`~pams.logs.MarketStepPrintLogger` と "
":class:`~pams.logs.MarketStepSaver` "
"は、各ステップの市場価格を記録するだけです（:doc:`first_simulation` "
"を参照）。このチュートリアルでは、各セッションの概要を出力し、すべての取引をCSVファイルに保存するロガーを作成します。完全なスクリプトは "
":download:`tutorial_custom_logger.py <code/tutorial_custom_logger.py>` "
"です。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:14
msgid "The logger"
msgstr "ロガー"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:16
msgid ""
"A logger inherits from :class:`~pams.logs.Logger` and overrides the "
"methods of the logs it needs. The others do nothing:"
msgstr ""
"ロガーは :class:`~pams.logs.Logger` "
"を継承し、必要なログのメソッドをオーバーライドします。それ以外のメソッドは何もしません："

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:23
msgid "Method"
msgstr "メソッド"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:24
msgid "Log"
msgstr "ログ"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:25
msgid "``process_simulation_begin_log``, ``process_simulation_end_log``"
msgstr "``process_simulation_begin_log``、``process_simulation_end_log``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:26
msgid ""
":class:`~pams.logs.SimulationBeginLog`, "
":class:`~pams.logs.SimulationEndLog`"
msgstr ":class:`~pams.logs.SimulationBeginLog`、:class:`~pams.logs.SimulationEndLog`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:27
msgid "``process_session_begin_log``, ``process_session_end_log``"
msgstr "``process_session_begin_log``、``process_session_end_log``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:28
msgid ""
":class:`~pams.logs.SessionBeginLog`, :class:`~pams.logs.SessionEndLog` "
"(``log.session``)"
msgstr ""
":class:`~pams.logs.SessionBeginLog`、:class:`~pams.logs.SessionEndLog` "
"（``log.session``）"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:29
msgid "``process_market_step_begin_log``, ``process_market_step_end_log``"
msgstr "``process_market_step_begin_log``、``process_market_step_end_log``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:30
msgid ""
":class:`~pams.logs.MarketStepBeginLog`, "
":class:`~pams.logs.MarketStepEndLog` (``log.session``, ``log.market``), "
"for each market at each step"
msgstr ""
":class:`~pams.logs.MarketStepBeginLog`、:class:`~pams.logs.MarketStepEndLog`"
" （``log.session``、``log.market``）。各ステップで市場ごとに1つ"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:32
msgid "``process_order_log``"
msgstr "``process_order_log``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:33
msgid ":class:`~pams.logs.OrderLog`, for each order a market has received"
msgstr ":class:`~pams.logs.OrderLog`。市場が受け取った注文ごとに1つ"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:34
msgid "``process_cancel_log``"
msgstr "``process_cancel_log``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:35
msgid ":class:`~pams.logs.CancelLog`, for each cancel order a market has received"
msgstr ":class:`~pams.logs.CancelLog`。市場が受け取った取消注文ごとに1つ"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:36
msgid "``process_expiration_log``"
msgstr "``process_expiration_log``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:37
msgid ""
"``ExpirationLog``, for each order removed from the order book because of "
"its ``ttl``"
msgstr "``ExpirationLog``。``ttl`` によって板から削除された注文ごとに1つ"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:38
msgid "``process_execution_log``"
msgstr "``process_execution_log``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:39
msgid ":class:`~pams.logs.ExecutionLog`, for each execution"
msgstr ":class:`~pams.logs.ExecutionLog`。約定ごとに1つ"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:41
msgid ""
"The order, cancel, expiration and execution logs give the IDs of the "
"market and of the agents. The other logs give the simulator "
"(``log.simulator``)."
msgstr "注文、取消、失効、約定のログは、市場とエージェントのIDを持ちます。それ以外のログはシミュレーター（``log.simulator``）を持ちます。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:49
msgid "``__init__`` must call ``super().__init__()``."
msgstr "``__init__`` では ``super().__init__()`` を呼び出す必要があります。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:50
msgid ""
"The runner sets ``self.simulator`` when the runner is created, before the"
" simulation starts. The logger uses it to find the names of the market "
"and of the agents from their IDs."
msgstr ""
"ランナーは、シミュレーションの開始前、ランナーの作成時に ``self.simulator`` "
"を設定します。このロガーはそれを使って、IDから市場とエージェントの名前を調べます。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:52
msgid ""
"An :class:`~pams.logs.ExecutionLog` gives the step (``time``), the "
"market, the buyer and the seller, their order IDs, the price and the "
"volume of one execution."
msgstr ""
":class:`~pams.logs.ExecutionLog` "
"は、1つの約定のステップ（``time``）、市場、買い手と売り手、それぞれの注文ID、価格、数量を持ちます。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:54
msgid ""
"The logger keeps the executions in memory and writes the file at the end "
"of the simulation. This also keeps it usable with the process runner, "
"which cannot copy a logger that holds an open file (see :ref:`config-"
"parallel`)."
msgstr ""
"このロガーは約定をメモリに保持し、シミュレーションの終わりにファイルを書き出します。これにより、開いたファイルを保持するロガーをコピーできないプロセスランナーでも使えます（:ref"
":`config-parallel` を参照）。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:60
msgid "When the logs are processed"
msgstr "ログが処理されるタイミング"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:62
msgid ""
"The market step logs are processed at once, during the step. So, in "
"``process_market_step_end_log``, the market is at the end of that step, "
"which is how :class:`~pams.logs.MarketStepSaver` reads its prices."
msgstr ""
"市場ステップのログは、そのステップの中ですぐに処理されます。そのため、``process_market_step_end_log`` "
"の時点で市場はそのステップの終わりの状態にあり、:class:`~pams.logs.MarketStepSaver` "
"はこれを利用して価格を読み出しています。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:65
msgid ""
"The order, cancel, expiration and execution logs are kept by the logger "
"until it receives the next session or simulation log, at the beginning or"
" at the end of a session or of the simulation. They are then processed in"
" the order they happened, before that log. In ``process_execution_log``, "
"the market and the agents are therefore already at the end of the "
"session: use the fields of the log, not the current state of the market "
"or the agents."
msgstr ""
"注文、取消、失効、約定のログは、ロガーが次のセッションまたはシミュレーションのログ（セッションまたはシミュレーションの開始時か終了時）を受け取るまで、ロガーに保持されます。その後、そのログより先に、発生した順に処理されます。したがって、``process_execution_log``"
" "
"の時点で、市場とエージェントはすでにセッションの終わりの状態にあります：市場やエージェントの現在の状態ではなく、ログのフィールドを使ってください。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:71
msgid ""
"In this logger, the orders and executions of a session are counted when "
"the session ends, just before ``process_session_end_log`` prints them."
msgstr ""
"このロガーでは、セッションの注文と約定は、セッションが終わるとき、``process_session_end_log`` "
"がそれらを出力する直前に数えられます。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:76
msgid "Using the logger"
msgstr "ロガーの使用"

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:78
msgid "A runner takes one logger:"
msgstr "ランナーはロガーを1つ受け取ります："

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:85
msgid ""
"To record several things, handle them all in one logger. "
"``run_simulation(seed=42, path=\"trades.csv\")`` prints the summaries of "
"the two sessions, then the two time lines of ``main()``:"
msgstr ""
"複数のものを記録するには、それらをすべて1つのロガーで扱ってください。``run_simulation(seed=42, "
"path=\"trades.csv\")`` は、2つのセッションの概要を出力し、その後 ``main()`` の2行の時間を出力します："

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:95
msgid ""
"In each step, one FCN agent places one order (``maxNormalOrders`` is 1), "
"and orders are only executed in the ``main`` session. ``trades.csv`` "
"starts with:"
msgstr ""
"各ステップで1体のFCNエージェントが1つの注文を出し（``maxNormalOrders`` は1）、注文は ``main`` "
"セッションでのみ約定します。``trades.csv`` の先頭は次のとおりです："

#: ../../source/user_guide/tutorials/custom_logger.rst:105
msgid ""
"At step 100, the first step of ``main``, the orders placed during "
"``warmup`` start to be executed."
msgstr "``main`` の最初のステップであるステップ100で、``warmup`` 中に出された注文が約定し始めます。"

